# Build-time configuration only.
#
# These three values are compiled into the frontend JavaScript when the Docker
# image is built. Everything else CHOps needs, including SESSION_SECRET and the
# admin credentials, is supplied at runtime and must NOT be put here.
#
# On a CI machine, copy this to .env.build and fill it in.

VITE_SELECTEDAID_DBS=
VITE_QURIOZ_KEY=
VITE_QUERYGENERATIONURL=
